(8412, 266, 'What is the purpose of defining constraints in a project?', 'To state limits such as time, budget, and technology', 'To hide difficulties', 'To increase scope', 'To delay work', 'A', 'Constraints clarify what limits the project faces.', 'INTERMEDIATE', 2, 'MCQ', 1),
(8413, 266, 'Why is a gap analysis performed?', 'To compare current state with the desired state', 'To delete old code', 'To format disks', 'To write tests', 'A', 'Gap analysis identifies what is missing between current and target states.', 'INTERMEDIATE', 2, 'MCQ', 1),
