(8415, 266, 'Which document evaluates technical options for solving the problem?', 'Feasibility and alternatives analysis', 'The test log', 'The invoice', 'The meeting minutes', 'A', 'Alternatives analysis compares possible solutions.', 'INTERMEDIATE', 2, 'MCQ', 1),
