(8424, 266, 'Which technique translates stakeholder needs into project goals?', 'Requirements elicitation and analysis', 'Deleting files', 'Formatting disks', 'Rebooting servers', 'A', 'Elicitation captures actual stakeholder needs.', 'ADVANCED', 3, 'MCQ', 1),
