(8427, 266, 'What does a project vision statement provide?', 'A long-term picture of the desired outcome', 'A list of bugs', 'A code sample', 'A budget', 'A', 'The vision aligns the team toward the end goal.', 'ADVANCED', 3, 'MCQ', 1),
(8428, 266, 'Which measure indicates a project''s business value?', 'The alignment of outcomes with organizational goals', 'The number of commits', 'The screen size', 'The meeting length', 'A', 'Business value is tied to strategic goals.', 'ADVANCED', 3, 'MCQ', 1),
