(8561, 276, 'A feature was cut from the original scope but a stakeholder insists it is added back. Which practice best handles this?', 'Formal change control that assesses impact before approving the change', 'Silently adding it without updating the plan', 'Deleting all documentation', 'Refusing to talk to stakeholders', 'A', 'Formal change control evaluates how a scope change affects cost, time and quality before approval.', 'INTERMEDIATE', 2, 'MCQ', 1),
