(8566, 276, 'A student creates a project with a clear goal but no measurable success criteria. What is the main risk?', 'Success cannot be objectively verified at the end', 'The code will not compile', 'The database will overflow', 'The network will slow down', 'A', 'Without measurable criteria, neither the team nor evaluators can objectively judge whether the project met its goal.', 'INTERMEDIATE', 2, 'MCQ', 1),
